  "title": "5 Tiers of Project Car “Upgrades”",
  "summary": "The vast majority of vintage cars are project cars. Whether intentional by the owner or not, keeping up with old iron requires periodic projects and upkeep. While there are always places or ways to spend our hard-earned money on a project, some expenditures may prove more worthwhile than others. Not everything is black and white […]",
